<title>USA: Southern Pacific Funding sets stock split.</title>
<headline>Southern Pacific Funding sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE OSWEGO, Ore. 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southern Pacific Funding Corp said Tuesday its board had declared a three-for-two stock split, payable January 23, record January 9.</p>
<p>The split will increase outstanding shares to 20,737,500, it said.</p>
